 IDENTIFICATION                  DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID.                     GAISEP1O.

****************************************************************
 ENVIRONMENT                     DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION                   SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     CONSOLE  IS  DSPMSG.
 INPUT-OUTPUT                    SECTION.
 FILE-CONTROL.

     SELECT  帳票ファイル
             ASSIGN             TO  GS-XU04LP
             SYMBOLIC  DESTINATION  "PRT"
             PROCESSING       MODE  処理種別１
             FORMAT                 定義体名１
             GROUP                  項目群名１
             FILE           STATUS  F1-STS.

     SELECT  作業実績
             ASSIGN             TO  DA-01-VI-CJISFL4
             ORGANIZATION           INDEXED
             ACCESS                 SEQUENTIAL
             RECORD                 作業－作業コード
                                    作業－実績職場コード
                                    作業－製番
                                    作業－項目
             FILE           STATUS  F2-STS.

     SELECT  組織マスタ
             ASSIGN             TO  DA-01-VI-ASOSML1
             ORGANIZATION           INDEXED
             ACCESS                 RANDOM
             RECORD                 組織－部所コード
                                    組織－担当者係コード
             FILE           STATUS  F3-STS.

     SELECT  受注項目
             ASSIGN             TO  DA-01-VI-AJUKFL1
             ORGANIZATION           INDEXED
             ACCESS                 RANDOM
             RECORD                 受注－製番
                                    受注－受注項目
             FILE           STATUS  F4-STS.

     SELECT  原価項目
             ASSIGN             TO  DA-01-VI-AGEKFL1
             ORGANIZATION           INDEXED
             ACCESS                 RANDOM
             RECORD                 原価－製番
                                    原価－項目
             FILE           STATUS  F5-STS.

****************************************************************
 DATA                            DIVISION.
 FILE                            SECTION.

 FD  帳票ファイル.
     COPY  GAISEIP1  OF  XMDLIB  JOINING  Ｐ      AS  PREFIX.

 FD  作業実績.
     COPY  CJISFL4   OF  XFDLIB  JOINING  作業    AS  PREFIX.

 FD  組織マスタ.
     COPY  ASOSML1   OF  XFDLIB  JOINING  組織    AS  PREFIX.

 FD  受注項目.
     COPY  AJUKFL1   OF  XFDLIB  JOINING  受注    AS  PREFIX.

 FD  原価項目.
     COPY  AGEKFL1   OF  XFDLIB  JOINING  原価    AS  PREFIX.

****************************************************************
 WORKING-STORAGE                 SECTION.

******************
